flowchart TB
    start[Approved character and one raid target<br/>Evaluate at the scheduled start]
    match[Resolve realm, instance and shared difficulty rules]
    evidence[Check observation freshness and save-scan completeness]
    active[Check matching save at raid start<br/>Including extension and reset evidence]
    unknown[Needs fresh sync<br/>Never report confirmed availability]
    locked[Locked through raid<br/>Block signup and roster selection]
    reset[Resets before raid<br/>Eligible with visible reset time]
    free[Available<br/>Fresh data confirms no active matching save]
    combined[Combined raid verdict<br/>Locked wins; otherwise unknown wins]
    exception[Officer exception<br/>Unknown only, reason visible, verdict unchanged]

    start -->|identity matches raid realm| match
    match -->|resolved| evidence
    match -->|mapping uncertain| unknown
    evidence -->|fresh and complete| active
    evidence -->|stale, missing or incomplete| unknown
    active -->|confirmed active at start| locked
    active -->|observed save expires before start| reset
    active -->|confirmed no matching active save| free
    active -->|extension or reset uncertain| unknown
    locked -->|any required target| combined
    unknown -->|any required target and none locked| combined
    reset -->|all required targets eligible| combined
    free -->|all required targets eligible| combined
    unknown -->|officer records scoped reason| exception

    classDef internal fill:#cfe2f3,stroke:#2c5aa0,stroke-width:1px,color:#000
    classDef external fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#666,stroke-width:1px,color:#000
    class start,match,evidence,active,combined internal
    class unknown,locked,reset,free,exception external
